      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if another power signal toggles at approximately the same time as your \"1 ms every 8s\" pulse? Then, you\u0027ll sample the periodic pulse, and maybe make a wrong conclusion about the actual power state?",
      "revId": "8a0f40a830ae314fbdf2fedf1845556a9e4e2316",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
