      "writtenOn": "2015-11-02T20:47:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, S0ix only transitions back to S0? Are things handled correctly if we unexpectedly power-down from S0ix? (Ex. SOC unexpectedly loses power, do we transition from S0ix --\u003e S0 --\u003e S3 --\u003e S5 correctly?).",
      "revId": "8a0f40a830ae314fbdf2fedf1845556a9e4e2316",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
